[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466165751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98953#issuecomment-2466165751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98953","id":2466165751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S_rP3","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-09T10:36:54Z","updated_at":"2024-11-09T10:36:54Z","body":"I am not sure there is much else to be expected from similar navmesh layouts.\r\n\r\nSome of those navmesh edges are just too long and slim. With such geometry like in the demo the basic core triangle functions alone will add so much float imprecision to cause problems.\r\n\r\nYou need to break up the navmesh edge layout, e.g. by tiling a world, to mitigate such precision issues.\r\n\r\nIn general there will always be a slight float difference between the input positions and the output positiosn when you query a path because things are remapped to the closest position on navmesh surface which also adds small float variance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2466165751/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]